research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/cor-uniform-cauchy-criterion-function-series.md:52:[L1] The series $\sum f_k$ converges uniformly exactly when its partial-sum sequence $(S_r)$ converges uniformly ([[def-series-of-real-functions]]).
research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/cor-uniform-cauchy-criterion-function-series.md-53-
research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/cor-uniform-cauchy-criterion-function-series.md-54-[L2] A sequence of real-valued functions converges uniformly exactly when it is uniformly Cauchy ([[thm-uniform-cauchy-criterion-real-functions]]).
