research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/cor-uniform-cauchy-criterion-function-series.md:56:[L3] For $n>m$, $\sum_{k=m+1}^{n}f_k(x)=S_{n+1}(x)-S_{m+1}(x)$, and $|-u|=|u|$ for every real $u$ ([[def-series-of-real-functions]], [[lem-of-abs-value]]).
